ACADEMIC USE NOTICE:
This software was developed as part of a Bachelor's dissertation project at
City College, University of York Europe Campus. When using this software for
academic purposes, please cite:

Vaitsopoulou, V. A. (2025). Bridging Research-Grade Models and Consumer 
Wearables: A Personalized Federated Learning Approach to Stress Prediction. 
Master's Dissertation, City College, University of York Europe Campus.

THIRD-PARTY ACKNOWLEDGMENTS:
This project uses the WESAD dataset, which should be cited separately:
Schmidt, P., Reiss, A., Duerichen, R., Marberger, C., & Van Laerhoven, K. (2018).
Introducing WESAD, a multimodal dataset for wearable stress and affect detection.
In Proceedings of the 20th ACM International Conference on Multimodal Interaction 
(ICMI '18).

